# Dual-GPU --resident-experts on a layer split. Not merged in Niko1221/Strata v0.1.38.
# GPU expert caches fill first; RAM gets only the experts no card holds; PLE/n-gram stay on the GGUF.
# Apply from the Strata tree after clone: patch -p1 < patches/resident-on-split-v0.1.38.patch
# (patches/apply_local.py does this.)
#
# Upstream:
#   https://github.com/Niko1221/Strata/issues/604  resident-on-split still on the list
#   https://github.com/Niko1221/Strata/issues/364  dual GPU + low RAM -> mmap workaround
#   https://github.com/Niko1221/Strata/issues/384  layer split + resident rewritten to mmap
#   https://github.com/Niko1221/Strata/issues/498  UD-Q4 split has no RAM budget (~135 GB)
#   https://github.com/Niko1221/Strata/issues/730  budget alloc fail -> empty RAM / SSD
#   https://github.com/Niko1221/Strata/issues/737  #498 follow-up: split just below 135 GB
#   https://github.com/Niko1221/Strata/pull/639    layer split loads only own dense (more expert VRAM)
#   https://github.com/Niko1221/Strata/pull/640    STRATA_ARENA_MMAP=1 mapped expert arena
#   https://github.com/Niko1221/Strata/pull/731    disjoint helper vs primary expert slots
#
